 "notes": "Old flat lists turned into archetypes with versions; leftovers kept in m (≤20). AirPods range moved out of Closed-back (earbuds belong in True wireless earbuds, shelf 00_01); AirPods Max now in Wireless noise-cancelling. MDR-CD900ST moved from On-ear to Closed-back as a relative of MDR-7506 (it is circumaural). Stax SR-007/009/404/507/4070 moved from Open-back to Electrostatic headphones; Sennheiser HE-1 likewise. Dropped duplicate entries only (ThieAudio-style repeats none here). Years left blank where no retrieved page gave them (HD 580/600/650 years conflict across sources). Gaming headset picks from RTINGS gaming page; office headsets not sourced, so only types. Wikidata helper returned HTTP 429 throughout."
}